ralcomfortac.com – Cynthia Garrido – Office Manager g.ramos@centralcomfortac.com – Gina Ramos – Dispatch Team g.ramos@centralcomfortac.com – Andre Galeas – Dispatch Team customerservice@centralcomfortac.com – Customer Service – Customer Service Team y.bover@centralcomfortac.com – Yesenia Bover – Dispatch Team g.perez@centralcomfortac.com – Gabriel Perez – Dispatch Team   We need to add the license number for Central Comfort Air Conditioning:  Central Comfort Air Conditioning Corporation License: CAC057552   We need to add the blanket additional insured, waiver of subrogation, primary non contributory wording for the GL and the waiver of subrogation wording for the WC.   Last but not least, I need the workers comp applications to send to the insured to be signed and return to the WC carrier Luba. We didn’t send them with the proposal and the carrier is asking for them.  We need to send them for signature to centralcomfortacmiami@yahoo.com - MARTINEZ, ALEX A – Owner & President. CC me and Damian Aroche (cfo) d.aroche@centralcomfortac.com   Thank you team! If you need anything from me to help with this request let me know.   Alejandro Bello Commercial Property & Casualty Advisor, Head of HVAC Contractors Division 201 Alhambra Cir, Suite 900, Coral Gables, FL 33134 o: 786.454.2029 | c: 786.355.0449 alejandro.bello@usi.com   | www.usi.com |   USI ONE ADVANTAGE ® | Our Approach to Client Solutions. Watch Video > EXECUTIVE INSIGHTS | Guidance on Top Issues from USI Experts. Access Insights > TOP INSURANCE EMPLOYER | Multiple Industry Awards and Recognitions! View Awards >   Please note that you may not rely on email communication to us to report a claim or to give us instructions to place, bind, change or terminate coverage unless we have subsequently confirmed to you in writing that we have received your message and will be taking the action you have requested.   Confidentiality Notice: The information contained in this email message including any attachments is for the s