 Good morning,   Welcome to USI! I’m thrilled that you have chosen USI to be your trusted insurance advisor. We are fully committed to help you build a comprehensive program that protects you and your business. This is an exciting time, and we are delighted that you are a part of our growth and continued success.   To best service your needs, I will be your main point of contact for the management of your program.  Alejandro Bellow and I will be working together to ensure that the quality of service you are receiving fully meets your expectations.   Certificates of Insurance: If you need a specific COI, email your request to selectcommercial@usi.com or directly to me. Please be sure to include the name and address of the certificate holder and any requested wording from the holder. A sample COI is also helpful, if they provide this. Turnaround is usually within a few hours, but we can certainly accommodate urgent request, if needed.   If you have any coverage questions , need to make policy changes , or want to add coverages to your program with us, please don’t hesitate to let me know. I’ll coordinate with our team and our partners to make it happen. All of my contact information is in my signature below.   I look forward to working with you and greatly appreciate the opportunity!   All the best,   Donna Veach Account Manager – Select Commercial Lines Unit USI Insurance Services  Direct: 629-895-7909 Office: 855-874-1270 Donna.veach@usi.com | www.usi.com |   We value and appreciate your feedback.  Please let my manager know about your recent experience by emailing Sandra Lazogue at sandra.lazogue@usi.com .         ACH Drafts are free! A 3.25% Credit Card Processing fee applies to all Credit Card Transactions.

