sked to give an update on the status of a couple of Draws and was wondering if you or Michael had any news.   Thank you,   Marlene Torres On 01/22/2026 12:28 PM EST Sandra Lorie < slorie@nv2agroup.com > wrote:     Mike, The COI was uploaded to Textura. I have uploaded it to myCOI and agents are reviewing. thanks,   Sandra Lorie, CRIS Subcontracts and Insurance Manager 9100 South Dadeland Blvd. Datran One, Suite 600 Miami, FL 33156   O 786.496.9549 F 786.233.5062 E slorie@nv2agroup.com www.nv2agroup.com     From: Michael Roman < mroman@nv2agroup.com > Sent: Thursday, January 22, 2026 12:01 PM To: 'Marlene Torres' < mtorres@ajfroofingfl.com > Cc: Janette Diaz < jdiaz@ajfroofingfl.com >; Sandra Lorie < slorie@nv2agroup.com > Subject: SDTOC | AJF COI   Good afternoon Marlene,   Have you uploaded your certificates to mycoitracking.com?   Please message here once you do and Sandra will review.   Thak you,   Michael Roman Project Controls 9100 South Dadeland Blvd. Datran One, Suite 600 Miami, FL 33156   C   305.746.9589 O   786.233.5060 E    mroman@nv2agroup.com Caution: This is an external email. Be careful when clicking links or opening attachments. If in doubt, contact ICG’s Service Desk.

