obs for.   The Acord submitted has 6 employees listed but $85,744 in total payroll, which seems small split between 6 people. Does the insured have at least 3 full time employees not including owners and/or officers?   They have at least 3 full time employees aside from the owners.   Lastly, could you please provide currently valued loss runs for at least the past 3 policy periods? – Loss runs have been requested, and we are waiting on them.   I may have more questions to follow here if given favorable responses to the above.   Thanks again!   Best regards,   Jacob Smith Small Business Underwriter | jsmith@fhmic.com FHM Insurance Company Phone: (904) 854-2767 www.fhmic.com * Check out our NEW website! FHM Connect   From: Branden Cantrell < branden.cantrell@usi.com > Sent: Thursday, January 29, 2026 10:30:54 AM To: Paul Ferreira < pferreira@fhmic.com > Cc: Alejandro Bello < alejandro.bello@usi.com > Subject: Xtreme Pumping Solutions, Corp - Quote Request to Carrier   EXTERNAL EMAIL - This email was sent by a person from outside your organization. Exercise caution when clicking links, opening attachments or taking further action, before validating its authenticity.   Hello Paul,   I have this new business prospect that I would like you to consider.   Submission Recap Need by Date 2-14-206 Description of operations (brief overview) See account summary. Lines of Business Workers Compensation Target Premium/Range Best Offer Current Carrier BiBerk – Workers Comp Notes Still waiting Work Comp Loss Reports   Attached Documents: Account Summary ACORDs Driver List Vehicle List   Please let me know if there is any additional information you require for your file. FILEATTRIBUTENAME:SagittaClientID FILEATTRIBUTEVALUE:2107681 FOLDERATTRIBUTENAME:PolicyID FOLDERATTRIBUTEVALUE:24338283   Branden Cantrell National Select Marketing Resource USI Insurance Services CA License No. 0F58937 O: 612.509.1013 |C: 612.213.9362 | f: 610.537.1954 branden.cantrell@usi.com   | www.usi.com     THE